NOTICE — albert_server

This project implements a local emulator of Apple's Albert activation service
(albert.apple.com) and a mitmproxy interceptor (firmware_restore_proxy.py) for
iOS firmware restore testing. It is provided for educational and research
purposes and for activating devices you own or have explicit permission to test.

